{
  "id": "渤海",
  "name": "渤海",
  "pinyin": "",
  "aliases": [
    "渤之海"
  ],
  "type": "river",
  "typeConfidence": "high",
  "description": "此处当指南海，非今日所指之渤海",
  "mentions": [
    {
      "bookId": "shanhaijing",
      "chapterIndex": 1,
      "entryId": "shanhaijing-01-28",
      "type": "annotation",
      "annotationExplanation": "此处当指南海，非今日所指之渤海"
    },
    {
      "bookId": "shanhaijing",
      "chapterIndex": 1,
      "entryId": "shanhaijing-01-28",
      "type": "text",
      "context": "上多金玉。丹水出焉，而南流注于渤海。有鸟焉，其状如鸡，五采而文，"
    },
    {
      "bookId": "shanhaijing",
      "chapterIndex": 1,
      "entryId": "shanhaijing-01-29",
      "type": "text",
      "context": "，多白猿。汎水出焉，而南流注于渤海。"
    },
    {
      "bookId": "shanhaijing",
      "chapterIndex": 11,
      "entryId": "shanhaijing-11-13",
      "type": "annotation",
      "annotationExplanation": "一说指蒲昌海，即今新疆东南部的罗布泊"
    },
    {
      "bookId": "shanhaijing",
      "chapterIndex": 11,
      "entryId": "shanhaijing-11-13",
      "type": "text",
      "context": "水出东北隅，以行其北，西南又入渤海；又出海外，即西而北，入禹所导"
    },
    {
      "bookId": "shanhaijing",
      "chapterIndex": 13,
      "entryId": "shanhaijing-13-23",
      "type": "text",
      "context": "济水出共山南东丘，绝钜鹿泽，注渤海，入齐琅槐东北。"
    },
    {
      "bookId": "shanhaijing",
      "chapterIndex": 13,
      "entryId": "shanhaijing-13-24",
      "type": "text",
      "context": "潦水出卫皋东，东南注渤海，入潦阳。"
    },
    {
      "bookId": "shanhaijing",
      "chapterIndex": 13,
      "entryId": "shanhaijing-13-25",
      "type": "text",
      "context": "晋阳城南，而西至阳曲北，而东注渤海，入越章武北。"
    },
    {
      "bookId": "shanhaijing",
      "chapterIndex": 13,
      "entryId": "shanhaijing-13-26",
      "type": "text",
      "context": "漳水出山阳东，东注渤海，入章武南。"
    },
    {
      "bookId": "soushenji",
      "chapterIndex": 10,
      "entryId": "soushenji-10-08",
      "type": "text",
      "context": "何罪过？而听用邪孽，使绝其命！渤海王悝，既已自贬，又受诛毙。今宋"
    },
    {
      "bookId": "soushenji",
      "chapterIndex": 11,
      "entryId": "soushenji-11-05",
      "type": "text",
      "context": "渤海太守史良，好一女子，许嫁而不果"
    },
    {
      "bookId": "soushenji",
      "chapterIndex": 29,
      "entryId": "soushenji-29-15",
      "type": "text",
      "context": "郡，每太守到官，无几辄死。后有渤海陈斐见授此郡，忧恐不乐，就卜者"
    },
    {
      "bookId": "huainanzi",
      "chapterIndex": 5,
      "entryId": "huainanzi-05-01",
      "type": "text",
      "context": "不死。\n\n河水出昆仑东北陬，贯渤海，入禹所导积石山。赤水出其东南"
    }
  ],
  "firstSeen": {
    "bookId": "shanhaijing",
    "chapterIndex": 1
  }
}
